      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਦੋਵੇਾਂ) ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਦੇ ਰਸ ਵਿਚ ਲਗ ਗਏ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रस रीति रच्यो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100823",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੁਹੂੰ ਮੈਨ ਮਚ੍ਯੋ ॥੨੯॥",
      "transliteration": "dhuhoo(n) main machayo ||29||",
      "translation": "The king caught her arm and that woman kept silent, absorded and dyed with love, both became lustful.29.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਕਿਉਾਂਕਿ) ਦੋਹਾ ਅੰਦਰ ਕਾਮ (ਦਾ ਭਾਵ) ਮਚਿਆ ਹੋਇਆ ਸੀ ॥੨੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दुहूँ मैन मच्यो ॥२९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100824",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਭਾਤਿ ਭਜੀ ॥",
