      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਰਾਜੇ ਨੇ ਉਸ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨਾਲ) ਬਹੁਤ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਭੋਗ ਕੀਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु भाति भजी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100825",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਿਸ ਲੌ ਨ ਤਜੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nis lau na tajee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਰਾਤ ਤਕ (ਉਸ ਨੂੰ) ਨਾ ਛਡਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "निस लौ न तजी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100826",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੋਊ ਰੀਝਿ ਰਹੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhouoo reejh rahe ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੋਵੇਾਂ (ਇਕ ਦੂਜੇ ਉਤੇ) ਰੀਝੇ ਹੋਏ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दोऊ रीझि रहे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100827",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹੀ ਜਾਤ ਕਹੇ ॥੩੦॥",
      "transliteration": "nahee jaat kahe ||30||",
      "translation": "The king enjoyed her in various ways till night both of them felt so much pleased with each other that is the not possible for me to narrate.30.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਸ ਦਾ) ਕਥਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ॥੩੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नही जात कहे ॥३०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100828",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਸ ਰੀਤਿ ਰਚ੍ਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ras reet rachayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਹ) ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਰਸ ਦੀ ਰੀਤ ਵਿਚ ਲੀਨ ਹੋ ਗਏ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रस रीति रच्यो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100829",
