      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मधि परन कुटी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100838",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਜਾਤ ਭਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap jaat bhayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜਾ ਉਥੋਂ ਚਲਾ ਗਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप जात भयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100839",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਹ ਗਰਭ ਰਹਿਯੋ ॥੩੩॥",
      "transliteration": "teh garabh rahiyo ||33||",
      "translation": "After that woman having enjoyed the sexual sport, came out of that cottage, the king went away and Shakuntala became pregnant.33.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ (ਸ਼ਕੁੰਤਲਾ) ਨੂੰ ਗਰਭ ਠਹਿਰ ਗਿਆ ॥੩੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिह गरभ रहियो ॥३३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100840",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਿਨ ਕੈ ਕੁ ਗਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhin kai k ge ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕੁਝ ਸਮਾ ਬੀਤ ਗਿਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दिन कै कु गए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100841",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਨਿ ਭੂਰ ਜਏ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tin bhoor je ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਨੇ ਬੱਚੇ ('ਭੂਰ') ਨੂੰ ਜਨਮ ਦਿੱਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिनि भूर जए ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100842",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਨਿ ਕਉਚ ਧਰੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tan kauch dhare ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਬੱਚੇ ਨੇ) ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਉਤੇ ਕਵਚ ਧਾਰਨ ਕੀਤਾ ਹੋਇਆ ਸੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तनि कउच धरे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100843",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਸਿ ਸੋਭ ਹਰੇ ॥੩੪॥",
      "transliteration": "sas sobh hare ||34||",
      "translation": "Many days passed, when she gave birth to a child, who was wearing armour on his body and was also the abductor of moon’s beauty.34.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਦੀ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ ਨੂੰ ਹਰਦਾ ਸੀ ॥੩੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ससि सोभ हरे ॥३४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100844",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਨੁ ਜ੍ਵਾਲ ਦਵਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jan javaiaal dhavaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇੰਜ ਪ੍ਰਤੀਤ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ) ਮਾਨੋ ਜੰਗਲ ਦੀ ਅਗਨੀ (ਦੀ ਲਾਟ ਹੋਵੇ)।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जनु ज्वाल दवा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100845",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਸ ਤੇਜ ਭਵਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "as tej bhavaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ (ਉਸ ਦਾ) ਤੇਜ ਹੋ ਰਿਹਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अस तेज भवा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100846",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਿਖਿ ਜੌਨ ਪਿਖੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rikh jauan pikhai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੋ ਵੀ ਰਿਸ਼ੀ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖਦਾ ਸੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रिखि जौन पिखै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100847",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚਿਤ ਚਉਕ ਚਕੈ ॥੩੫॥",
      "transliteration": "chit chauk chakai ||35||",
      "translation": "His splendour was like the forest-fire, whosoever saw him, he was wonder-struck.35.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਹੈਰਾਨੀ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਸੀ ॥੩੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चित चउक चकै ॥३५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100848",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਿਸੁ ਸ੍ਰਯਾਨ ਭਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sis srayaan bhayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਦੋਂ ਬੱਚਾ ਸਿਆਣਾ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सिसु स्रयान भयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100849",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਰਿ ਸੰਗ ਲਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kar sa(n)g layo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤਦ ਸ਼ਕੁੰਤਲਾ ਨੇ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ) ਨਾਲ ਲੈ ਲਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "करि संग लयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100850",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚਲਿ ਆਵ ਤਹਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chal aav tahaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਉਥੇ ਚਲ ਕੇ ਆ ਗਈ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चलि आव तहा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100851",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਹ ਤਾਤ ਜਹਾ ॥੩੬॥",
      "transliteration": "teh taat jahaa ||36||",
      "translation": "When the child grew a bit older, she (the mother) took him there where his father was.36.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਥੇ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਪਿਤਾ ਸੀ ॥੩੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिह तात जहा ॥३६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100852",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਦੇਖਿ ਜਬੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap dhekh jabai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਦ ਰਾਜੇ ਨੇ (ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਵੇਖਿਆ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप देखि जबै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100853",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਰਿ ਲਾਜ ਤਬੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kar laaj tabai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਦ ਬਹੁਤ ਲਜਾ ਅਨੁਭਵ ਕੀਤੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "करि लाज तबै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100854",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਯਹ ਮੋ ਨ ਸੂਅੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "yeh mo na sooa(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਅਤੇ ਕਹਿਣ ਲਗਾ) ਇਹ ਮੇਰਾ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "यह मो न सूअं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100855",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤ੍ਰੀਅ ਕੌਨ ਤੂਅੰ ॥੩੭॥",
      "transliteration": "treea kauan tooa(n) ||37||",
      "translation": "When the king saw her, he hesitated a little and asked her ”O” woman, who are you and who is this boy?”37.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਇਸਤਰੀ! ਤੂੰ ਕੌਣ ਹੈਂ? ॥੩੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "त्रीअ कौन तूअं ॥३७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100856",
      "sourceShabadId": "9293",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤ੍ਰੀਯੋ ਬਾਚ ਰਾਜਾ ਪ੍ਰਤਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "treeyo baach raajaa prat ||",
      "translation": "Speech of the woman addressed to the king:",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਪ੍ਰਤਿ ਕਿਹਾ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "त्रीयो बाच राजा प्रति ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100857",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਰਿ ਬੋਲ ਮਨਾ ਛੰਦ ॥",
      "transliteration": "har bol manaa chha(n)dh ||",
      "translation": "HARIBOLMANA STANZA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹਰਿ ਬੋਲ ਮਨਾ ਛੰਦ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हरि बोल मना छंद ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100858",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0049",
      "lineIndex": 49,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਨਾਰਿ ਸੁਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap naar suiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਮੈਂ ਉਹੀ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਹਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप नारि सुई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100859",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0050",
      "lineIndex": 50,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤੁਮ ਜੌਨ ਭਜੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tum jauan bhajee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਨਾਲ ਤੂੰ ਭੋਗ ਕੀਤਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तुम जौन भजी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100860",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0051",
      "lineIndex": 51,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮਧਿ ਪਰਨ ਕੁਟੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "madh paran kuTee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕੱਖਾ ਦੀ ਕੁਲੀ ਵਿਚ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मधि परन कुटी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100861",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0052",
      "lineIndex": 52,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਹ ਕੇਲ ਠਟੀ ॥੩੮॥",
      "transliteration": "teh kel ThaTee ||38||",
      "translation": "“O king! I am the same woman, with whom you had had sexual enjoyment in the forest-cottage.38.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤੁਸੀਂ) ਕਾਮ-ਕ੍ਰੀੜਾ ਰਚਾਈ ਸੀ ॥੩੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तह केल ठटी ॥३८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100862",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0053",
      "lineIndex": 53,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਬ ਬਾਚ ਦੀਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tab baach dheeyo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਦ (ਤੁਸੀਂ) ਬਚਨ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਸੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तब बाच दीयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100863",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0054",
      "lineIndex": 54,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਬ ਭੂਲਿ ਗਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ab bhool gayo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੁਣ ਭੁਲ ਗਏ ਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अब भूलि गयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100864",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0055",
      "lineIndex": 55,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਸ ਚਿਤ ਕਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tis chit karo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ (ਘਟਨਾ) ਨੂੰ ਯਾਦ ਕਰੋ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिस चित करो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100865",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0056",
      "lineIndex": 56,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੁਹਿ ਰਾਜ ਬਰੋ ॥੩੯॥",
      "transliteration": "muh raaj baro ||39||",
      "translation": "“Then you had given your word now you have forgotten, O king! remember that promise and now own me.39.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਮੈਨੂੰ ਵਿਆਹ ਲਵੋ ॥੩੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मुहि राज बरो ॥३९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100866",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0057",
      "lineIndex": 57,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਬ ਕਾਹਿ ਭਜੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tab kaeh bhajo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਦ ਕਿਉਾਂ ਭੋਗ ਕੀਤਾ ਸੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तब काहि भजो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100867",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0058",
      "lineIndex": 58,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਬ ਮੋਹਿ ਤਜੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ab moh tajo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੇ ਹੁਣ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਛਡ ਦੇਣਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अब मोहि तजो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100868",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0059",
      "lineIndex": 59,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਪੂਤ ਤੁਅੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh poot tua(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਹ ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह पूत तुअं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100869",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0060",
      "lineIndex": 60,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਨੁ ਸਾਚ ਨ੍ਰਿਪੰ ॥੪੦॥",
      "transliteration": "sun saach nirapa(n) ||40||",
      "translation": "“If now you are forsaking me, then why did you own me at that time? O king! I am saying the truth that he is your son.40.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰਾਜਨ! ਸੁਣੋ, (ਮੈਂ) ਸੱਚ ਕਹਿ ਰਹੀ ਹਾ ॥੪੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुनु साच नृपं ॥४०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100870",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0061",
      "lineIndex": 61,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹਿ ਸ੍ਰਾਪ ਤੁਝੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "neh sraap tujhai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਹੀਂ ਤਾ (ਮੈਂ) ਤੈਨੂੰ ਸ੍ਰਾਪ (ਦੇਵਾਗੀ)।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नहि स्राप तुझै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100871",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0062",
      "lineIndex": 62,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭਜ ਕੈਬ ਮੁਝੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhaj kaib mujhai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੇਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਭੋਗ ਕਰ ਕੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भज कैब मुझै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100872",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0063",
      "lineIndex": 63,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਬ ਤੋ ਨ ਤਜੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ab to na tajo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੁਣ ਨਾ ਤਿਆਗੋ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अब तो न तजो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100873",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0064",
      "lineIndex": 64,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹਿ ਲਾਜ ਲਜੋ ॥੪੧॥",
      "transliteration": "neh laaj lajo ||41||",
      "translation": "“If you will not wed me, then I shall curse you, therefore now do not forsake me and do not feel shy.”41.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਲਾਜ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਰਮਿੰਦੇ ਨਾ ਹੋਵੋ ॥੪੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नहि लाज लजो ॥४१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100874",
      "sourceShabadId": "9294",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0065",
      "lineIndex": 65,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਬਾਚ ਤ੍ਰੀਯਾ ਸੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap baach treeyaa so ||",
      "translation": "Speech of the king addressed to the woman",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜੇ ਨੇ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਹਾ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप बाच त्रीया सो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100875",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0066",
      "lineIndex": 66,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੋਈ ਚਿਨ ਬਤਾਉ ॥",
      "transliteration": "koiee chin bataau ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕੋਈ ਨਿਸ਼ਾਨੀ ਦਸ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कोई चिन बताउ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100876",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0067",
      "lineIndex": 67,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿਤੋ ਬਾਤ ਦਿਖਾਉ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kito baat dhikhaau ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਾ) ਕੋਈ ਗੱਲ ਸਪਸ਼ਟ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਵਿਖਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कितो बात दिखाउ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100877",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0068",
      "lineIndex": 68,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਉ ਯੌ ਨ ਭਜੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "hau yau na bhajo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੈਂ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਭਜਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हउ यौ न भजो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100878",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0069",
      "lineIndex": 69,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹਿ ਨਾਰਿ ਲਜੋ ॥੪੨॥",
      "transliteration": "neh naar lajo ||42||",
      "translation": "You may tell me some sign or saying, otherwise I shall not wed You; O woman! Do not forsake your shyness 42.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਹੀ ਹੇ ਇਸਤਰੀ! ਮੈਨੂੰ ਕੋਈ ਲਜਾ ਹੈ ॥੪੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नहि नारि लजो ॥४२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100879",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0070",
      "lineIndex": 70,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਕ ਮੁਦ੍ਰਕ ਲੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eik mudhrak lai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਇਕ ਮੁੰਦਰੀ ਲੈ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इक मुद्रक लै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100880",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0071",
      "lineIndex": 71,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਕੈ ਕਰਿ ਦੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap kai kar dhai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜੇ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਦੇ ਦਿੱਤੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप कै करि दै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100881",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0617_line_0072",
      "lineIndex": 72,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਦੇਖਿ ਭਲੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh dhekh bhalai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਅਤੇ ਕਿਹਾ-) ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਦੇਖ ਲੌ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 617,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह देखि भलै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100882",
      "sourceShabadId": "9295",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
}
